{"seq":63,"slug":"web-payments-api","title":"网页支付接口","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api","rating":{"composite":3.92,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"网页支付接口\">网页支付接口</h1><p>收银台是电商链路上最贵的一段路。每多一个需要手填的卡号字段，转化率就掉一截；而把信用卡明文收进自己的表单，又会把整个站点拖进 PCI DSS 的合规深水区。浏览器原生的 Payment Request API 正是为这两个矛盾而生：它让站点把「收集支付凭据」这件事交还给浏览器与钱包，自己只描述「要收多少钱、需要哪些信息」，最终拿到一份可以直接交给收单方的、已被令牌化的支付响应。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 讲的是「前端如何正确地接入网页支付」，四条主线层层递进。<strong>基础</strong>先回答动机与心智模型：为什么不再自己写卡号表单、一笔支付里有哪些参与方、浏览器靠什么标识「微信支付」还是「Apple Pay」。<strong>请求</strong>进入 API 本身的三段式生命周期——用 <code>PaymentRequest</code> 构造一笔意图、调 <code>show()</code> 唤起原生界面并随用户选择动态更新金额、最后在 <code>PaymentResponse</code> 里拿到结果并决定成功或重试。<strong>集成</strong>把目光转向后端边界：响应里那串密文是什么、怎么交给支付网关换成扣款，以及 Google Pay、Apple Pay 两大钱包各自的接线方式与商户验证握手。<strong>实践</strong>收口于工程现实：PCI 合规与 SCA/SPC 强认证、在不支持的浏览器上如何渐进降级回传统表单、以及把这套东西真正稳定上线要面对的测试与边界问题。</p>\n<p>读这个 hub 前，最好先理解浏览器如何发起网络请求与管理会话（见 <a href=\"../browser-and-web-api/networking/fetch-and-xmlhttprequest\">Fetch 与 XMLHttpRequest</a>），以及基本的传输层安全（见 <a href=\"../frontend-security/security-architecture/https-and-tls\">HTTPS 与 TLS</a>）——Payment Request 强制要求安全上下文，没有 HTTPS 一切免谈。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</strong>要划清楚，否则会越界重复：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../browser-and-web-api/\">浏览器与 Web API（07）</a> 讲通用浏览器能力（fetch、存储、worker），本 hub 只用它们做支撑，不重讲。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../frontend-security-engineering/\">前端安全工程（39）</a> 与 <a href=\"../frontend-security/\">前端安全（17）</a> 讲 CSRF、令牌、TLS 等通用安全机制；本 hub 的「支付安全」只讲支付特有的 PCI/SCA/SPC，通用部分一律链接过去。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../frontend-form-engineering/\">表单工程（43）</a> 讲受控表单、校验与可访问性；本 hub 的「降级」会复用这些能力来构造回退表单，但表单本身的工程问题归它。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../pwa-production-engineering/\">PWA 生产工程（35）</a> 讲 Service Worker 与推送；Payment Handler API 让钱包以 Service Worker 形态运行，本 hub 只在集成处点到，机制细节归它。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>：产品/前端新手按「基础 → 请求 → 实践」走，先建立心智模型再写代码，集成章可等真正对接网关时再读；做支付对接的工程师可「基础 → 请求 → 集成 → 实践」全程通读；只关心合规与安全的同学可直接从 <a href=\"practice/payment-security\">支付安全与 PCI</a> 切入，再回溯 <a href=\"foundations/payment-flow-model\">支付流程模型</a>。<strong>前置知识</strong>：Promise 与事件机制、基本的 HTTP 与 JSON、对一次线上刷卡大致流程的常识。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-payment-request","title":"为何 Payment Request","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/foundations/why-payment-request"},{"seq":2,"slug":"payment-flow-model","title":"支付流程模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/foundations/payment-flow-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"payment-methods","title":"支付方式标识","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/foundations/payment-methods"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"request","title":"请求","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/request","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"payment-request-construction","title":"构造 PaymentRequest","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/request/payment-request-construction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"show-update-flow","title":"展示与动态更新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/request/show-update-flow"},{"seq":3,"slug":"payment-response","title":"支付响应处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/request/payment-response"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"integration","title":"集成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tokenization-gateways","title":"令牌化与网关","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/integration/tokenization-gateways"},{"seq":2,"slug":"google-apple-pay","title":"Google/Apple Pay 钱包接入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/integration/google-apple-pay"},{"seq":3,"slug":"merchant-validation","title":"商户验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/integration/merchant-validation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"payment-security","title":"支付安全与 PCI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/practice/payment-security"},{"seq":2,"slug":"payment-fallback","title":"降级与渐进增强","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/practice/payment-fallback"},{"seq":3,"slug":"payments-in-practice","title":"落地与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-payments-api/practice/payments-in-practice"}]}]}